For RDX/ADX architecture diagrams, use this consistent mapping:

| Architecture element | Color |
|---|---|
| Main title and API gateway headers | Deep corporate blue |
| VCAS | Bright blue |
| VCAS Relay | Light blue with blue border |
| Middleware / Common Utilities | Bright green |
| APIM | Corporate blue |
| RDX Step Up | Clear red |
| RDX Initiate Action | Bright blue or blue-tinted header |
| RDX Validate | Clear orange |
| Issuer / Bank | Orange or light orange |
